This directory contains a refactored copy of the original single-file demo
`18-flip.html` (Ten Minute Physics episode 18, "FLIP fluid"). The simulation
code in src/core/FlipFluid.js is a faithful port of the original; see
../README.md for the list of changes and the parity results.
